        "4": "AA2/1 IC10.Pin5   (data bus A1 = 74LS245 A-side bit 1)",
        "5": "AA2/1 IC10.Pin7   (data bus A2 = 74LS245 A-side bit 2)",
        "6": "AA2/1 IC10.Pin10  (data bus A3 = 74LS245 A-side bit 3)",
        "7": "AA2/1 IC20.Pin11  (74LS273 CLK = data-valid strobe for ext. latches)"
      },
      "text": "Clip the 8 LA channels to the AA2/1 bus:\n  - 8 channel clips as listed below\n  - 1 GND clip on AA2/1 GND (e.g. Pin 10 of any 74LSxx, or the AA2 TP_GND)\n\nNOTE on A/B/C labels: IC11's Y outputs carry the 3-bit address field, but which Y-output is A, B, or C is not in the wiki. Verify against page-014 Fig. 3 of the service manual before drawing diagnostic conclusions.\n"
